{
  "text": "Hello, today I will give a busy person's intro to Large Language Models. Think of an LLM as a lossy zip file of the internet. Through pre-training, the model compresses web knowledge into trillions of parameters. It does not memorize verbatim; it learns the underlying patterns and grammar of human thought. Pre-training builds the raw intelligence, while fine-tuning shapes it into an assistant.",
